==History==
2017
*The Executioner [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 27/1/2017.
*On 13/2/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (13/2/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased the Executioner's damage by 6%, the range to 4.5 tiles (from 5 tiles), the projectile range to 6.5 tiles (from 7 tiles), and the axe's area radius to 0.9 tiles (from 1 tile). This update also fixed some glitches where the Executioner's axe would hit enemies behind him when it came back, would do damage in front of him when the axe was at its furthest, cause enemy attack animations to reset to 0 when it hit small to medium-sized enemies and caused him to sometimes throw his axe out of the [[Arenas|Arena]] and getting stuck.
*On 13/3/2017, the [[Version History#March 2017 Update (13/3/2017)|March 2017 Update]], increased the axe's radius to 1 tile (from 0.9 tiles) and decreased his projectile speed to 550 (from 600). This update also changed the Executioner's card image and fixed all of the bugs of the Executioner mentioned above.
*On 19/4/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/4/2017)|Balance Update]], increased the Executioner's damage by 6%.
*On 12/6/2017, the [[Version History#June 2017 Update (12/6/2017)|June 2017 Update]], changed the sound effect of his axe throw.
2018
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Epic}} cards start at Level 6 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 8).
2019
*On 28/1/2019, the [[Version History#January%202019%20Update%20(28/1/2019)|January 2019 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Executioner from Jungle Arena to Spooky Town.
*On 2/9/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/9/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Executioner's damage by 82% and decreased his axe return time to 1 second (from 1.5 seconds). However, his range was decreased to 3 tiles (from 4.5 tiles), his projectile range was decreased to 4.5 tiles (from 6.5 tiles), his attack time interval was increased to 2.5 seconds (from 2.4 seconds), his first attack time interval was increased to 0.7 seconds (from 0.5 seconds), and his hitpoints were decreased by 5%.
*On 5/9/2019, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (5/9/2019)|maintenance break]], increased the Executioner's damage by 2% and increased his range to 4 tiles (from 3 tiles).
*On 30/9/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20September%202019%20Update%20(30/9/2019)|End of September 2019 Update]], decreased his first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.7 seconds). This change was not mentioned in any change notes and was later said to be unintentional by Supercell, and as such it got reverted in 1/10/2019, in a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (1/10/2019)|maintenance break]].
*On 4/11/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (4/11/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Executioner's projectile range to 5 tiles (from 4.5 tiles), increased the axe's hover time to 1.2 seconds (from 1 second), and decreased his area radius to 0.8 tiles (from 1 tile).
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], increased the Executioner's hitpoints by 5%, decreased his attack time interval to 2.4 seconds (from 2.5 seconds), decreased his first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.7 seconds), increased the axe's hover time to 1.5 seconds (from 1.2 seconds), increased his range to 4.5 tiles (from 4 tiles), increased his projectile range to 6.5 tiles (from 5 tiles), increased his area radius to 1 tile (from 0.8 tiles), and decreased his damage by 45%.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Executioner from Spooky Town to Serenity Peak.
*On 2/9/2021, a maintenance break, added a card render to the Executioner's card info screen.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
*On 7/12/2021, the [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(7/12/2021)|2021 Quarter 4 Update]], increased the Executioner's hitpoints by 5%.
2022
*On 2/8/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(2/8/2022)|Balance Update]], increased the Executioner's projectile range to 7.5 tiles (from 6.5 tiles).
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Executioner's damage by 0.59%. It also allowed the Executioner to be affected by [[Rage]].
*On 7/4/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (7/4/2025)|April 2025 Update]], added the Executioner's Evolution.
2026

* On 2/3/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Executioners damage by 7%.
* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Executioner's projectile range to 7 tiles (from 7.5 tiles)

