==Trivia==
*In the Korean and Arabic language settings of the game, the Executioner's name translates to "Axeman". In the Chinese and Thai language settings of the game, the Executioner's name translates to "Throwing Axe Butcher" and "Hangman" respectively.
*The word Executioner comes from the Latin stem ex(s)equi, meaning to follow out.
*The Executioner is 1 of 3 [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] that has been featured with a [[Buff#Stun Attack|Stun Attack]] [[buff]], the others being [[Spear Goblins]] and [[Witch]].
*The Executioner's axe can be seen can be seen on the [[Trophies|Trophy Road]] as a decoration.
*The Executioner, along with the [[Minions]], [[Bomber]], [[Skeletons]], [[Skeleton Dragons]], [[Ice Spirit]], [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.|Mini P.E.K.K.A]], [[Mega Minion]], [[Ice Golem]], [[Dart Goblin]], [[Elixir Golem]], [[Goblin Cage|Goblin Brawler]], [[Guards]], [[Baby Dragon]], [[P.E.K.K.A.|P.E.K.K.A]], [[Giant Skeleton]], [[Golem]], [[Wall Breakers]], [[Bowler]], [[Mega Knight]], [[Inferno Dragon]], [[Royal Ghost]], and [[Lava Hound]], are featured as a [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Monsters monster] in [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Squad_Busters_Wiki Squad Busters].
*When the Executioner is defeated, his axe falls to the ground after it returns back to his death spot. The other units that drop an item upon death are the [[Knight]], [[Rascals|Rascal Boy]], Mega Minion, [[Dark Prince]], Mega Knight, [[Sparky]], [[Fisherman]], [[Super Knight]], [[Golden Knight]], and the [[Little Prince]].
*In the Japanese language setting of the game, the Executioner's personal name is revealed to be "''Falche''".
*The Executioner is the subject of 2 [[Emotes]].
*The initial balance change for Executioner on the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/9/2019)|September 2019 Update]] was a 98% damage increase, a range decrease to 3.5-5 tiles (from 4.5-6.5 tiles), and a decreased axe return time decrease to 1.1 seconds (from 1.5 seconds), but the damage increased was lowered to 82%, the range decrease was lowered to 3-4.5 tiles, and his axe return time was lowered to 1 second [https://twitter.com/ClashRoyale/status/1168426165599711233?s=20 last minute].

